          "kicker": "Fitness boost",
          "heading": "Jean-Baptiste Gros shakes off injury doubt to make France bench against Springboks",
          "body": "A doubt all week, Gros is named among France's replacements for the Nations Championship final at Twickenham. He is part of a 6-2 split alongside fellow prop Régis Montagne and hooker Peato Mauvaka, with Jefferson Poirot starting at loosehead. The prop had been set to face Argentina last weekend until he felt discomfort at the captain's run. Fabien Galthié insisted that naming him meant there was no uncertainty, while conceding that zero risk does not exist."
