      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Playmaker praise",
          "heading": "Andy Farrell hails Sam Prendergast's new authority after player-of-the-match Australia display",
          "body": "The Leinster out-half, 23, started all four of Ireland's Nations Championship wins — over Argentina, Fiji, South Africa and Australia. He capped the month by kicking six from six off the tee in Friday's 38-14 defeat of the Wallabies and supplying the kick-pass for Rob Baloucoune's try. Farrell pointed to a change in his approach: \"I think coming into camp I saw a shift in how he’s demanding of not just himself but of others as well.\" The head coach also credited extra pace built through hard pre-season work."
        },
